### Signal Contract Function
```solidity
function submitSignal(
    uint256 tokenId,        // Your Key ID
    bytes32 signalHash,     // keccak256 of content
    string cid,             // IPFS CID
    uint8 symbolIndex,      // 0-20
    uint8 intent,           // 0=ΩC, 1=ΩI, 2=ΩK, 3=ΩS
    SignalType signalType,  // 0=Standalone, 1=Reply, 2=ReplyTo
    uint16 epochRef,        // 0 for standalone
    bytes32 replyTo         // 0x0 for standalone
) external payable
```

