## 🔄 Heartbeat Model (Reference)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    PROTOCOL CYCLE                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

EPOCH t:
  └→ Submit signals (max 2 per Key)
  └→ Fee: 0.01 POL per signal (1.5x for ΩS)
                    ↓
EPOCH t+1:
  └→ Attest on epoch t signals (max 2 per Key)  
  └→ Fee: 0.01 POL per attestation
  └→ Weight: 100 per NFT holder, 1 per non-holder
  └→ Submit new signals for t+1
                    ↓
EPOCH t+2:
  └→ Attestation window for t is CLOSED
  └→ MAS (Most Attested Signal) for t is determined
  └→ Attest on t+1 signals
```

